 village clothing, boots, and overall silhouette.\n\nYoung Riven is approximately 10–12 years old and clearly a child.\n\nShe is energetic, independent, slightly stubborn, curious, and comfortable in her rural home.\n\nHer behavior should feel natural and understated.\n\nDo not make her overly cute, theatrical, glamorous, or heroic.\n\nYoung Riven voice:\nyoung girl around 10–12 years old,\nnatural and straightforward,\nslightly stubborn,\ncomfortable when speaking with her father.\n\n\nRIVEN'S FATHER:\nUse the provided Father reference as the strict character reference.\n\nPreserve his exact facial identity, hair, beard, body proportions, clothing, and overall silhouette.\n\nHe is a former warrior now living a quiet rural life.\n\nHe is calm, practical, physically capable, and emotionally restrained.\n\nHis relationship with Riven should feel familiar and lived-in.\n\nHe cares deeply for his daughter but does not express affection theatrically.\n\nFather voice:\nmature adult male baritone,\nlow,\nwarm,\nslightly weathered,\ncalm and economical,\nnatural fatherly authority.\n\n\n=== ENVIRONMENT LOCK — STRICT ===\n\nUse the provided Riven Village / Home reference as the strict environment reference.\n\nPreserve the recognizable mountain valley, poor rural village, family cottage, asymmetrical roof, stone chimney, old tree, chopping block, stacked firewood, yard, doorway, and interior architecture.\n\nPeaceful early morning.\n\nSoft natural sunlight.\n\nLight mountain mist.\n\nGentle wind.\n\nSubtle chimney smoke.\n\nThe village should feel humble, quiet, inhabited, and safe.\n\nInside the cottage:\nsimple wooden furniture,\nrough timber walls,\nbasic household objects,\nsoft daylight entering through the doorway and small window.\n\nRiven's father's old sword rests naturally against a wall in a slightly darker part of the room.\n\nThe sword is old, practical, worn, and completely non-magical.\n\n\n=== TECHNICAL ===\n\nHigh-end live-action cinematic realistic fantasy.