en approaches and puts the small bundle of firewood beside the existing stack.\n\nWithout making a big deal of it, she replies:\n\n\"I know.\"\n\nHer father notices a little dirt on her clothing.\n\nHe studies her briefly.\n\nFather:\n\n\"What happened?\"\n\nRiven avoids his eyes for just a moment.\n\nRiven:\n\n\"Nothing.\"\n\nA short silence.\n\nHer father clearly suspects there is more to the story.\n\nHe does not interrogate her.\n\nA very small amused smile appears on his face.\n\nRiven notices.\n\nShe gives him a slightly defensive look, as if she knows he does not believe her.\n\nKeep the interaction subtle and familiar.\n\nNo exaggerated comedy.\n\nNo sentimental acting.\n\nRiven then turns toward the cottage entrance.\n\nHer father calmly returns his attention to his work.\n\nRiven walks inside.\n\nCUT.\n\n\n=== SHOT 3 — SOMETHING INSIDE ===\n\nDuration approximately 6 seconds.\n\nInterior of the family cottage.\n\nCamera positioned behind and slightly to the side of Young Riven as she enters from the bright doorway.\n\nThe exterior morning light falls softly into the darker wooden interior.\n\nRiven walks several steps into the room.\n\nThe atmosphere becomes quieter.\n\nHer footsteps are audible against the wooden floor.\n\nShe casually looks around the familiar room.\n\nThen her movement gradually slows.\n\nShe stops.\n\nSomething outside the camera frame has caught her attention.\n\nDo not reveal the object yet.\n\nHold on Riven.\n\nHer playful expression disappears.\n\nIt is replaced by quiet curiosity.\n\nHer eyes remain fixed on something across the room.\n\nCUT.\n\n\n=== SHOT 4 — THE OLD SWORD ===\n\nDuration approximately 8 seconds.\n\nBegin with a close cinematic view of Riven's face.\n\nShe is completely still.\n\nHer eyes remain fixed forward.\n\nCut to what she sees.\n\nHer father's old sword rests against the wooden wall in a slightly darker corner of the cottage.\n\nIt is a practical old longsword:\nworn steel,\nsimple crossguard,\ndark leather grip,\nvisible signs of years of use.\n\nNo magic.\nNo glow.\nNo supernatural visual effect.\n\nThe sword should initially feel like an ordinary old object.\n\nVery slowly push the camera toward it.\n\nThe room is quiet.\n\nOnly distant outdoor ambience can be heard.\n\nThen compose the sword in the foreground with Young Riven visible softly in the background.\n\nShift focus slowly from the sword to Riven.\n\nShe takes one small step toward it.\n\nShe does not touch the sword.\n\nShe does not speak.\n\nHold on her curious expression.\n\nCUT TO BLACK.\n\n\n=== END STATE ===\n\nYoung Riven is inside the family cottage.\n\nShe has discovered her father's old sword resting against the wall.\n\nShe stands several steps away from it.\n\nShe is fascinated by the weapon but has not touched it.\n\nHer father remains outside the cottage.\n\nThe morning remains peaceful.\n\n\n=== MOOD ===\n\nWarm.\nQuiet.\nNostalgic.\nIntimate.\nGrounded.\n\nThe scene should not feel like a montage.\n\nThe audience should have enough time to observe Riven, her father, their home, and their relationship.\n\nThe emotional progression is simple:\n\npeaceful home\n→ familiar father-daughter interaction\n→ quiet interior\n→ curiosity\n→ discovery of the sword.\n\nThe old sword should not feel magical or ominous.\n\nWhat matters is Young Riven's fascination with it.\n\nEnd on curiosity, not action.", "reply_message_format": "生成された動画：%s"}}}, "chat_history_count": "0", "chat_id": "1482430191230993", "chat_next": "1", "client_report_scene": "gui", "commerce_feature_key": "doubao_create_pe", "cot_switch": "0", "creation_full_content": [{"PacketMeta": null, "BlockInfo": {"BlockType": 10000, "BlockContent": {"block_type": 10000, "block_id": "1482443049379089", "content": {"text_block": {"text": "この構成は約30秒です。現在、4～15秒の動画生成が可能です。最も近い15秒版で生成しますか？  \n1. はい、15秒に圧縮して生成  \n2. いいえ、別の秒数に調整してください"}}}, "BlockContentForTTS": "", "BlockContentForModel": null, "BlockMeta": {"block_id": "1482443049379089", "parent_bloc